dayz-server-operator (0.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: dzo binary, config.yaml conffile, dayz system
    user via sysusers.d/tmpfiles.d, subuid/subgid + linger setup in
    postinst. No instance management commands ship yet (Phase 1 is
    still in progress); see IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md.
  * Player bans with evidence (dzo ban, dzo evidence, web UI, API);
    new dependency modernc.org/sqlite (pure Go, statically linked).
  * Player actions: kick with a reason (BattlEye), heal, fix gear and kill
    (dzo-admin 0.2.0, which changes the packaged PBO), in the API, the CLI
    and the web player panel. New permissions player.kick, player.kill,
    player.heal, player.fixgear.
  * IP addresses are personal data: player.ip (operator) shows the current
    address, ip.history (admin) the stored ones; bans and evidence carry
    opaque references instead. New config keys serve.ip_retention_days
    (default 90) and serve.vacuum_days (default 7); the ban database
    schema gains migration 0002.
  * servermods.lock pins the servermod commits and PBO hashes; CI checks it.
  * The web interface ships a helicopter icon (Font Awesome Free 6.7.2,
    CC BY 4.0) that fonts-fork-awesome lacks; debian/copyright lists it.

 -- Bernd Zeimetz <bernd@bzed.de>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:00:00 +0000
